    "detailed_description": "Send your characters to adventures on different maps and watch them gather many kinds of exciting loot for you. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdana is an exciting world where each map is guarded by a guardian deity. Defeat the map monsters and bosses, then challenge the guardians for a chance to get even better loot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate your own build - Setup your skill rotation by using one basic ability, one special ability, one aura and 3 utility skills. Try various spells to see which one works best for your build.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild your team - Start the game as a warrior, then unlock the archer and priest characters and add them to your team.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRandomized loot - Inspired by traditional ARPG's, there are 4 rarities (normal, magic, rare, unique). Stats will get stronger as item level goes higher.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlchemy - You can create various consumables such as exp and drop charms or stat boosting potions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCrafting - Craft on existing items, upgrade their tiers or reshuffle their stats.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLoot - Several armor sets with randomized stats, 20+ unique items, multiple weapon types with more coming soon.",
    "about_the_game": "Send your characters to adventures on different maps and watch them gather many kinds of exciting loot for you. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdana is an exciting world where each map is guarded by a guardian deity. Defeat the map monsters and bosses, then challenge the guardians for a chance to get even better loot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreate your own build - Setup your skill rotation by using one basic ability, one special ability, one aura and 3 utility skills. Try various spells to see which one works best for your build.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild your team - Start the game as a warrior, then unlock the archer and priest characters and add them to your team.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRandomized loot - Inspired by traditional ARPG's, there are 4 rarities (normal, magic, rare, unique). Stats will get stronger as item level goes higher.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlchemy - You can create various consumables such as exp and drop charms or stat boosting potions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCrafting - Craft on existing items, upgrade their tiers or reshuffle their stats.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLoot - Several armor sets with randomized stats, 20+ unique items, multiple weapon types with more coming soon.",
    "short_description": "Let your team kill the bad guys and gather all sorts of loot for you to play with",
